<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Single Page Demo</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f4f4;">

    <div style="background: #4CAF50; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: white;">
        <h1 style="margin: 0;">Welcome to My Page</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6;">
            This is a simple single-page HTML file with inline CSS. 
            You can modify the styles directly inside the tags.
        </p>

        <button style="padding: 10px 20px; background: #4CAF50; border: none; color: white; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 5px;">
            Click Me
        </button>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #333; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 10px; margin-top: 30px;">
        <p style="margin: 0;">© 2026 My Simple Page</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
